OL,3,ATwins 'ran for our lives' as Krakow
OL,4,Aattack unfolded
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwin sisters who were in Krakow when a
OL,7,Fgunman killed six people have told how
OL,8,Fthey "ran for our lives" when they
OL,9,Fheard shots.
OL,11,FSienna and Rimini Chapman, 20, from
OL,12,FNorthallerton, North Yorkshire, were
OL,13,Fpart of a group celebrating a friend's
OL,14,F21st birthday in Poland when gunfire
OL,15,Fsounded in the city's Main Market
OL,16,FSquare at about 15:00 local time (14:00
OL,17,FGMT) on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
