OL,3,ATwins 'ran for our lives' as Krakow
OL,4,Aattack unfolded
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 24-year-old attacker, who died in
OL,7,Fhospital on Monday, fatally shot four
OL,8,FPolish citizens, a British national and
OL,9,Fan Austrian woman, while a further 15
OL,10,Fpeople, including two police officers,
OL,11,Fwere injured.
OL,13,FSienna told the BBC their experiences
OL,14,Fduring the attack had been
OL,15,F"terrifying".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
